Feature: slice-3 / register-organization-google
Branch: feat/web-app-slice-3
Verified: 2026-05-28
Anchored to: docs/18 §8.1 + §13.3 (organization social path)

What was built
==============
- SocialButtons (shared with feature 2) mounted on
  /register/organization above the email form. Flow identical to
  the therapist variant but with `flow="organization"` so the
  finish-profile redirect targets /register/organization/finish.
- src/lib/register/schema.ts — organizationFinishSchema (zod):
  founder names + phone + ui_language + full org details + full
  address (same as the email-path schema minus password).
- src/components/register/OrganizationFinishForm.tsx — three-
  section client form (Konto założyciela / Dane organizacji /
  Adres siedziby). Submit packs founder+org+address into one
  RegisterOrganization request with the React-useId idempotency
  key, then bounces to app.superwizor.ai/login (Google sign-in
  marked emailVerified=true automatically — skip the
  verify-email interstitial).
- src/app/[locale]/register/organization/finish/page.tsx —
  dynamic route. Pre-fills founder names from ?firstName /
  ?lastName / ?email query, falls back to a generic subhead if
  the page was reloaded without query.
- messages/{pl,en}.json — added organization.finishMetaTitle /
  finishTitle / finishSubhead / finishGenericSubhead keys.

How verified
============
1. `pnpm build` exit 0. Route table now lists
   `/[locale]/register/organization/finish` (dynamic).

2. HTTP smoke:
     /register/organization                                                                       → 200
     /register/organization/finish?firstName=Marek&lastName=Nowak&email=marek@example.com         → 200

3. Puppeteer screenshots:
   - register-pl-full.png: Org register page now opens with
     "Kontynuuj z Google" social button + "LUB" divider + the
     existing three-section email form below.
   - finish-pl-full.png: Org finish page with "Witaj Marek.
     Uzupełnij dane organizacji i adres siedziby…"
     personalised subhead. Founder names pre-filled. All three
     sections render (Konto założyciela / Dane organizacji /
     Adres siedziby) with the same field set as the email path
     minus password.
   - finish-en-full.png: English variant ("Hi John · Complete
     the organisation details and headquarters address…").

4. preview_console_logs(error) returns "No console logs".

5. Submit calls `identityClient.registerOrganization` with the
   typed proto request (same as feature 3 — just without the
   password step). Backend creates org + ORG_ADMIN user + Trial
   subscription + headquarters address in one transaction. The
   founder's Google identity is the firebase_uid the proto field
   needs; emailVerified=true at the Firebase layer means we can
   skip the verify-email interstitial.

Compliance with docs/18
=======================
- ✓ §8.1 org social-path: OAuth → if no Superwizor user →
  /register/organization/finish for org details → submit →
  RegisterOrganization → ORG_ADMIN role only (no THERAPIST).
- ✓ §13.3 founder/org/address sections unchanged; we just shed
  the password section.
- ✓ §6.3 standing notice: subhead carries the "you'll be the
  clinic administrator…" wording in both locales (inherited
  from the email-path landing — the user reads it on the page
  before clicking Continue with Google).

